WEBVTT

00:10.530 --> 00:11.360
Good morning.

00:11.360 --> 00:13.240
Oh. Yeah.

00:13.570 --> 00:15.450
<i>Ugh, this is pretty embarrassing.</i>

00:15.450 --> 00:18.160
<i>Are we going to see each other
like this every morning?</i>

00:18.160 --> 00:20.120
<i>What are we even supposed to talk about?</i>

00:20.450 --> 00:22.200
<i>I should probably
say good morning first.</i>

00:22.200 --> 00:25.960
Uh, while I was watching TV late at night,
a super minor movie started playing.

00:25.960 --> 00:29.420
I watched it until the sun came up
and slept in, so it's been an okay morning.

00:29.420 --> 00:30.590
Just say good morning.

00:30.750 --> 00:32.210
Good morning, sunshine!

00:32.590 --> 00:33.840
Good morning, sunshine.

00:34.930 --> 00:37.800
<i>Now that I think about it,
there's a girl from my class</i>

00:37.800 --> 00:39.970
<i>in the same house,
and that's unbelievable.</i>

00:39.970 --> 00:41.310
What's for breakfast?

00:41.310 --> 00:43.850
Croissant sandwich
and homemade yogurt.

00:43.850 --> 00:46.020
Hey, Keigo. Did you sleep well?

00:47.400 --> 00:53.360
Well, I was remembering all the trouble
I caused everyone yesterday, and got depressed.

00:53.360 --> 00:56.700
So I started reading a depressing manga,
ugly cried a lot, and then fell asleep.

00:56.700 --> 00:59.580
Weren't you watching a super minor movie?

00:59.580 --> 01:00.870
Goo mohn.

01:02.700 --> 01:04.210
Don't gag on your toothbrush.

01:04.210 --> 01:08.250
<i>A lifestyle of watching your various friends
wake up is really fun.</i>

01:08.580 --> 01:11.630
Hey Keigo.
Did you get your room all unpacked?

01:11.630 --> 01:16.050
Uh, so I'm kind of a hoarder, right?
Last night, I started going through

01:16.050 --> 01:21.810
my monochrome pictures that I took
with my SLR camera.

01:21.810 --> 01:24.600
You're actually negative and shy,
but you have this habit of trying

01:24.600 --> 01:28.150
to get people's attention by attempting
to be cool and talk a lot, don't you?

03:02.570 --> 03:09.540
KEIGO MAGAMI, THE WEREWOLF

03:02.990 --> 03:06.620
In other words,
it's not only a crescent moon...

03:06.620 --> 03:09.540
...but also things that you acknowledge
as crescent moon shaped,

03:09.540 --> 03:11.420
that can trigger a transformation, huh?

03:12.630 --> 03:14.540
And even during the daytime, too.

03:14.790 --> 03:17.760
But it's fine if you transform, right?

03:17.760 --> 03:19.880
Because we don't have a reason
to fight anymore.

03:19.880 --> 03:24.930
That's true, but he's a pretty selfish guy,
so he might cause some trouble.

03:26.310 --> 03:29.680
A characteristic of a werewolf
is to "give in to greed."

03:30.520 --> 03:33.560
Heavy sleeper. If he falls asleep,
it's hard for him to wake up.

03:33.560 --> 03:35.810
Plus his body is huge, so it's a nuisance.

03:35.940 --> 03:41.450
OM NOM NOM GWAR

03:36.230 --> 03:41.450
Appetite. If we aren't careful about this,
he'll eat everything in the house.

03:41.700 --> 03:42.360
And then sexual dr...

03:42.360 --> 03:43.950
Nope, nope, nope! Stop right there!

03:43.950 --> 03:47.240
Eek, so indecent, so obscene.
I saw that Lupin dive!

03:47.240 --> 03:51.960
I didn't think you were
that kind of person! You're the worst!

03:48.830 --> 03:51.960
No, no, I promise
nothing forceful will happen.

03:52.370 --> 03:55.840
But just like how female beasts
are drawn to strong males,

03:55.840 --> 03:58.090
he seems to draw women's attention.

03:58.090 --> 03:59.460
Which is the polar opposite of me.

04:00.970 --> 04:02.130
He's the only one...

04:02.800 --> 04:04.930
He gets to have a great time with women

04:04.930 --> 04:07.510
and I only get the cleanup
and no memory of what happened!

04:07.510 --> 04:10.430
- Does this only happen to me?
- Definitely just you!

04:10.430 --> 04:12.480
- I understand the situation.
- Stop it! Get off me already!

04:12.480 --> 04:15.310
We should lower the risk
of Keigo transforming in this house.

04:15.310 --> 04:16.480
Risk?

04:16.480 --> 04:20.230
Let's remove all the crescent-shaped
objects within the house.

04:20.230 --> 04:21.280
Yeah!

04:21.280 --> 04:23.490
That's such a weird chore.

04:24.240 --> 04:25.990
<i>Thirty minutes later...</i>

04:24.240 --> 04:25.990
30 MINUTES LATER

04:26.910 --> 04:28.910
Okay, that should be all of it.

04:28.910 --> 04:31.700
Not sure about the Date Masamune
figure, but just in case.

04:31.700 --> 04:33.500
Huh? Where's Keigo?

04:36.790 --> 04:37.710
It was the croissant!

04:37.710 --> 04:39.960
What a bothersome guy!

04:46.340 --> 04:47.510
Hey.

04:47.510 --> 04:49.510
Come eat something with me.

04:49.510 --> 04:50.640
O-Okay!

04:50.890 --> 04:52.180
You, with the ponytail.

04:52.180 --> 04:53.180
What?

04:53.180 --> 04:54.390
You, too.

04:54.390 --> 04:55.480
Sure!

04:55.480 --> 04:58.400
You and you, and all of you are coming.

05:00.400 --> 05:04.780
His money is my money, and I've got
lots of it. Everyone come along!

05:04.860 --> 05:06.280
What the hell are you doing?

05:06.660 --> 05:09.410
I finally found you,
and you're in the middle of a parade?

05:09.410 --> 05:11.660
And you ladies shouldn't
be following this baddie around!

05:11.660 --> 05:13.200
- Who're you?
- Boo!

05:13.200 --> 05:16.170
What're you gonna do if he turns out
to be a guy who sells cutlery knives?

05:16.170 --> 05:17.120
Then I'll buy some!

05:17.120 --> 05:18.460
You would?!

05:18.460 --> 05:20.540
Shoo, shoo! Go home already.

05:21.460 --> 05:22.550
Hey, Wolf.

05:22.880 --> 05:27.340
I am pretty pissed that you beat me up,
but that's all water under the bridge.

05:27.340 --> 05:31.180
I also won't interfere with whatever food
you want to eat since it's your money after all.

05:31.560 --> 05:32.600
But...

05:33.350 --> 05:36.230
I won't forgive you
for being popular with the ladies!

05:36.230 --> 05:38.520
That has nothing to do with anything!

05:38.520 --> 05:42.020
Turn back to Keigo and go home!
Why do we have to go and look for you?

05:42.020 --> 05:44.990
Are you like my childhood dog Pero
who would always chew their leash off?

05:44.990 --> 05:46.950
We are totally not the same thing!

05:47.490 --> 05:50.570
If you want me to listen,
then you're gonna have to make me.

05:50.780 --> 05:52.280
Let's go then.

05:52.280 --> 05:56.830
If I use all my tengu power, then you're
nothing but a toy poodle, ya dummy.

05:56.830 --> 05:58.080
Stop!

05:58.370 --> 06:00.670
Kan, Wolf, please stop!

06:00.670 --> 06:02.590
Please don't fight anymore!

06:02.590 --> 06:04.130
We're not in a soap opera!

06:04.590 --> 06:06.720
Wolf, please turn back to Keigo.

06:06.720 --> 06:08.630
No. I refuse. Denied.

06:08.840 --> 06:12.560
This is an order from a witch.
You're my familiar, right?

06:13.810 --> 06:15.220
Looks like it's working.

06:15.220 --> 06:19.350
Yeah, that's right! You're just a minion!
Listen to your master, Pero!

06:19.650 --> 06:22.820
That was just a verbal agreement,
not a formal pact.

06:22.820 --> 06:25.730
If you're in danger,
I'll protect you no matter what.

06:25.860 --> 06:28.650
But I won't let you
take away my freedom.

06:28.650 --> 06:30.410
- Yeah, that makes sense.
- Gave up already.

06:30.780 --> 06:32.160
There you are.

06:33.120 --> 06:34.160
Morihito.

06:34.580 --> 06:37.160
All right Wolf,
let's turn you back to Keigo.

06:44.750 --> 06:45.920
Fine.

06:47.050 --> 06:48.760
You'll listen to Morihito?

06:48.760 --> 06:51.300
What the heck? I'm kind of jealous!

06:51.300 --> 06:53.100
I did lose to him after all.

06:54.510 --> 06:56.180
<i>Wolves that move together in a pack</i>

06:56.180 --> 07:00.230
<i>have a habit of following the strongest leader,
known as the alpha.</i>

07:01.100 --> 07:04.230
Just until the time that I can beat you,

07:04.690 --> 07:07.070
I'll listen to you,

07:07.820 --> 07:09.990
Morihito.

07:10.240 --> 07:12.570
Yeah. Come at me anytime.

07:13.070 --> 07:18.290
What? Morihito? What, am I gonna
fight you? Here and now?

07:19.580 --> 07:23.420
You've got it rough, too, huh?
You gotta be with someone like that.

07:24.460 --> 07:25.670
That might be true.

07:25.920 --> 07:29.380
But I don't hate the guy, you know?

07:30.170 --> 07:34.300
Classmates who bullied me,
punks who stole money from me,

07:34.300 --> 07:37.390
the old man who looked
at my mom's wheelchair disdainfully.

07:37.390 --> 07:41.890
Those kinds of people were somehow getting
crushed one after the other by someone.

07:42.230 --> 07:47.610
That's when I finally noticed
that there was another me.

07:48.230 --> 07:51.900
When he becomes violent, it's usually
because there's a reason for it.

07:52.240 --> 07:55.910
I actually admire
his strength and sense of freedom.

07:56.370 --> 07:58.290
So, please get along with him if you can.

07:58.290 --> 07:59.410
Of course.

07:59.620 --> 08:02.500
You just had to say that honestly
from the beginning.

08:06.290 --> 08:10.420
KIND TIGER, PROUD WOLF

08:08.710 --> 08:11.630
<i>After witnessing that fierce battle
with the werewolf,</i>

08:11.630 --> 08:13.470
<i>I have reconsidered once again.</i>

08:14.260 --> 08:16.680
<i>I really want a strong familiar!</i>

08:17.010 --> 08:19.680
<i>And so, I've come here
to scout once again.</i>

08:20.020 --> 08:23.560
<i>That's right. I am only here to scout.</i>

08:23.560 --> 08:34.320
BLAH BLAH EXCUSES BLAH BLAH

08:23.890 --> 08:26.610
<i>I can't just walk up to him and say,
"Wanna become my vassal?"</i>

08:26.610 --> 08:28.690
<i>That'd be far too rude.</i>

08:28.690 --> 08:32.490
<i>I think the better strategy would be to come
visit as a cat, see what's going on,</i>

08:32.490 --> 08:34.320
<i>and once things get comfortable...</i>

08:34.860 --> 08:37.450
<i>I'm just making excuses for myself!</i>

08:38.120 --> 08:39.160
<i>I admit it!</i>

08:39.160 --> 08:41.870
<i>Honestly, I just want to be pet again,
so I've sneakingly come to visit.</i>

08:41.870 --> 08:43.580
<i>I'm such a dirty visitor cat.</i>

08:44.000 --> 08:46.750
<i>But it's much more difficult to say,
"I've come here to be pet,"</i>

08:46.750 --> 08:49.840
<i>rather than,
"Please become my familiar."</i>

08:50.590 --> 08:53.340
<i>And so, that's why...</i>

08:54.010 --> 08:55.550
<i>I'm going to be a cat today, too.</i>

08:55.550 --> 08:56.840
Pardon the intrusion.

08:58.890 --> 08:59.930
That cat's here again.

08:59.930 --> 09:01.470
I'll bring a foot towel.

09:01.600 --> 09:03.680
She really likes this place, huh?

09:04.350 --> 09:05.640
<i>Keigo Magami!</i>

09:05.640 --> 09:07.520
What, we get cat visitors?

09:07.730 --> 09:10.110
<i>Why is he here?</i>

09:10.860 --> 09:13.690
<i>Wolf knows that I'm Nemu Miyao.</i>

09:13.820 --> 09:17.780
<i>What if the dayside also knows
who I am and already told everyone?</i>

09:18.160 --> 09:24.460
<i>So you've come crawling back here with that
body that's been pet all over by me, huh?</i>

09:25.750 --> 09:27.080
<i>So embarrassing!</i>

09:27.080 --> 09:31.590
<i>It's as embarrassing as a person who's only
sexy online getting their identity discovered!</i>

09:31.590 --> 09:33.300
<i>I'm not doing that or anything!</i>

09:33.710 --> 09:36.550
<i>So, how close are they?</i>

09:36.840 --> 09:38.840
<i>If he's coming over
to visit on the weekend,</i>

09:38.840 --> 09:41.430
<i>then they must be friendly enough
to talk about anything.</i>

09:41.720 --> 09:45.560
Kanshi, last night, I could hear
you snoring from my room.

09:45.730 --> 09:47.690
<i>What? Are they living together?</i>

09:48.190 --> 09:50.560
<i>Nemu Miyao is a shapeshifter witch.</i>

09:50.560 --> 09:53.070
<i>Did he already tell them?</i>

09:53.690 --> 09:56.570
<i>But judging by the atmosphere,
I don't think he did.</i>

09:57.280 --> 09:58.200
<i>Conclusion!</i>

09:58.200 --> 10:02.200
<i>These four don't know my true identity,
and Wolf is the only one who does.</i>

10:02.700 --> 10:06.710
<i>So that means it would be really bad
if he transformed into Wolf.</i>

10:07.620 --> 10:10.750
<i>At a glance, I don't see any
crescent-shaped objects in this room.</i>

10:10.960 --> 10:14.210
<i>Power that will transform you.
Crescent Medicine.</i>

10:16.260 --> 10:17.930
<i>He transformed from the commercial?</i>

10:18.300 --> 10:22.300
Man, this feels great.
Crescent Medicine really does the job.

10:22.300 --> 10:24.060
Pretty sure that's not what it's for!

10:25.890 --> 10:28.810
This looks yummy,
I'm gonna eat all of it.

10:28.810 --> 10:31.690
Hey! I was gonna use that for dinner tonight.

10:34.400 --> 10:36.690
I'm gonna go punch a punk real quick.

10:36.860 --> 10:40.070
You can stay transformed,
but just keep a low profile, okay?

10:46.250 --> 10:48.330
Oh, he calmed down.

10:48.330 --> 10:50.580
He listens to Morihito after all.

10:53.460 --> 10:55.210
THUMP THUMP THUMP

10:56.340 --> 10:57.630
Hey, you're that Miya—

10:57.630 --> 10:59.800
Meow!

11:02.470 --> 11:04.050
<i>Please don't say anything!</i>

11:06.180 --> 11:10.100
All right, come here Kitty.
I bought a brush just for you.

11:10.850 --> 11:13.060
Oh, I have to go to work soon.

11:13.560 --> 11:16.820
I should go out and buy the ingredients
that Wolf devoured.

11:17.110 --> 11:19.570
Moi, can I come with you?

11:19.700 --> 11:21.910
Oh, but the kitty...

11:24.530 --> 11:26.080
<i>I see.</i>

11:26.290 --> 11:29.580
All right, I'll look after her.

11:30.000 --> 11:30.960
You sure?

11:43.800 --> 11:46.220
You made space so we could talk?

11:46.220 --> 11:49.600
I thought you might've wanted
to be alone with me.

11:50.020 --> 11:54.270
Well, yes, but I don't like
the way you said that.

11:54.270 --> 11:56.570
I wanted to talk to you
about something.

11:56.570 --> 12:00.950
Since you've repeatedly experienced
the ecstasy of being pet by Morihito,

12:00.950 --> 12:03.280
you've lost the opportunity
to say who you really are.

12:03.280 --> 12:06.740
So you've decided to try and hush me up
since I'm the only one who knows the truth.

12:07.030 --> 12:07.990
CORRECT

12:07.280 --> 12:07.990
<i>That's correct.</i>

12:08.160 --> 12:09.950
H-How did you...

12:09.950 --> 12:12.750
Feral instincts. So, I see.

12:12.750 --> 12:16.880
That means I've grasped your weakness.

12:16.880 --> 12:20.460
Th-That's why I'd like to make a deal.

12:22.510 --> 12:24.720
So I can do anything?

12:24.720 --> 12:26.260
Of course not!

12:27.050 --> 12:30.850
You're a cheeky woman
for trying to make a deal with me.

12:31.060 --> 12:34.310
Besides, I don't like
that you're attracted to Morihito.

12:34.310 --> 12:38.190
I-I am not attracted to him!
That's not how I feel!

12:38.650 --> 12:42.400
It's just that this body
can't forget the feeling of his touch.

12:42.400 --> 12:44.700
You're such a perv.

12:45.200 --> 12:47.490
All right, here's the deal.

12:47.780 --> 12:50.580
I want to eventually
become greater than Morihito.

12:51.290 --> 12:53.660
So, you get it, right?

12:54.540 --> 12:56.960
I want you...

13:01.800 --> 13:04.340
to come visit me once a month.

13:07.890 --> 13:11.020
And not as a cat, but as a human.

13:11.220 --> 13:15.850
If I don't transform periodically, my body
gets weaker and I get way too stressed out.

13:16.270 --> 13:20.820
Come to the Otogi house, get Keigo
to look at a crescent, and release me.

13:20.820 --> 13:24.240
If you do that, I won't tell anyone
about your secret.

13:25.950 --> 13:29.450
What? Did you think
I'd say something else?

13:29.450 --> 13:30.620
Not really.

13:30.620 --> 13:32.540
- I'm home.
- We're home!

13:32.540 --> 13:34.750
Whoa, hurry up and turn back into a cat!

13:40.040 --> 13:41.710
<i>Wh-What?</i>

13:42.170 --> 13:45.720
<i>This feeling! It's from that time...</i>

13:46.470 --> 13:48.970
<i>"Memory." By Nemu Miyao.</i>

13:50.010 --> 13:52.310
<i>My body remembers that feeling.</i>

13:52.720 --> 13:55.180
<i>My cells remember that sensation.</i>

13:55.770 --> 13:58.020
<i>My brain remembers that excitement.</i>

13:58.940 --> 14:03.650
<i>That day, when the bad witch
found me, you carried me away.</i>

14:04.280 --> 14:07.490
<i>Why? Why? Why did you do that?</i>

14:07.740 --> 14:10.410
<i>My eyes remember those huge pecs.</i>

14:10.410 --> 14:12.160
Hurry up already!

14:12.990 --> 14:15.250
Did you guys get along okay?

14:15.540 --> 14:17.580
What were you two doing?

14:18.670 --> 14:20.080
Having a super secret talk.

14:21.590 --> 14:25.710
Whoa, you are one interesting cat
if you can get along with a wolf.

14:25.710 --> 14:30.140
Whether they're cat or human,
if they're a female, they all come to me.

14:30.590 --> 14:31.890
You got that, Morihito?

14:31.890 --> 14:33.140
Not really.

14:34.640 --> 14:37.390
<i>I made a secret promise.</i>

14:37.980 --> 14:39.440
<i>From now on...</i>

14:40.520 --> 14:45.780
<i>I must undergo a mysterious mission to show
a crescent to that unrefined man once a month.</i>

14:41.150 --> 14:45.780
THAT UNREFINED MAN

14:46.360 --> 14:51.660
<i>Nemu Miyao's lifestyle of being
at the mercy of an ogre and a werewolf...</i>

14:52.160 --> 14:53.990
<i>will continue on!</i>

15:04.670 --> 15:06.380
I'm going to cook.

15:06.920 --> 15:13.760
EASY SPICES FOR ENTHRALLING COOKING

15:07.920 --> 15:09.510
Wh-What's wrong?

15:09.800 --> 15:13.470
I just feel bad having you
cook all the time.

15:13.470 --> 15:18.430
I-I appreciate the thought,
but I know what flavors I like,

15:18.430 --> 15:20.640
and then I make enough
for everyone else while I'm at it.

15:20.640 --> 15:24.820
Yeah but, I want to be pop...
I want to cook.

15:25.570 --> 15:28.190
Kara, your lunch is so delicious.

15:28.440 --> 15:31.320
As long as you're good at cooking,
anyone can get popular!

15:32.740 --> 15:36.450
Should be popular... So why...

15:36.450 --> 15:38.540
Don't cry, Kara.

15:39.330 --> 15:42.960
<i>I want to show Moi that I can cook
so he can notice me more!</i>

15:43.130 --> 15:46.420
But you've tried cooking
a few times before, haven't you?

15:46.420 --> 15:50.340
Yeah, and you ended up creating
this cursed, slime-like xiaolongbao,

15:47.670 --> 15:50.340
SAVE ME

15:50.340 --> 15:53.300
and this stew that looked like
a ripped bubble slime.

15:50.340 --> 15:55.600
PLEASE HELP ME

15:53.300 --> 15:55.600
They weren't all that slimy, were they?

15:55.720 --> 15:57.350
Well now I'm miffed!

15:57.350 --> 16:00.770
That's it, I'm definitely gonna
make you guys say, "That was delicious!"

16:00.770 --> 16:03.190
I'll make tomorrow's lunch, okay?

16:04.690 --> 16:07.400
Damn it, she's all fired up.

16:07.730 --> 16:09.070
RUMBLE RUMBLE

16:07.730 --> 16:13.200
A spell that'll make food tasty...

16:13.200 --> 16:18.080
At this point, I'll use illusions or magic
to make them feel that it tasted good.

16:20.450 --> 16:21.830
This is it!

16:22.290 --> 16:24.630
She's going to use magic after all.

16:24.880 --> 16:27.750
She can't withdraw
after getting in a heated discussion.

16:28.000 --> 16:29.630
<i>The next day...</i>

16:28.000 --> 16:29.630
THE NEXT DAY

16:30.260 --> 16:32.260
BLEURGH

16:34.390 --> 16:38.680
Is this sweet and sour pork? It looks like
a she-slime that got exploded to death.

16:38.680 --> 16:41.390
If it made noise,
it'd sound just like Big G's stew.

16:42.600 --> 16:44.140
But that's okay.

16:44.350 --> 16:46.770
Capcharm Powder!

16:49.070 --> 16:51.940
I just sprinkle this on, and...

16:53.780 --> 16:55.450
<i>She's sprinkling something on.</i>

16:55.450 --> 16:57.450
<i>Ogre Qigong Movement Style,
Stalking Panther!</i>

16:59.490 --> 17:02.450
Wow, this looks tasty.
I'll carry it to the table.

17:02.450 --> 17:03.910
Th-Thanks.

17:04.080 --> 17:06.920
<i>I protected one dish.
This one will be mine.</i>

17:06.960 --> 17:08.920
BIG G

17:07.210 --> 17:08.920
Okay, eat up!

17:09.130 --> 17:11.960
Thank you for the meal.

17:13.800 --> 17:16.300
What's wrong?
You haven't touched your food.

17:16.300 --> 17:19.180
Well, they do say that the grosser
it looks, the tastier it is.

17:19.560 --> 17:21.680
I think that phrase is for the ingredients.

17:21.970 --> 17:24.520
<i>This is the only plate
that doesn't have that powder.</i>

17:24.850 --> 17:26.980
<i>So it should taste different
from the others.</i>

17:29.440 --> 17:31.900
<i>Uh huh. This tastes gross after all.</i>

17:32.570 --> 17:35.820
<i>But don't you worry, Nico.
I'll make sure to eat everything.</i>

17:36.570 --> 17:38.990
<i>As for the plates that got sprinkled
with the mysterious powder,</i>

17:38.990 --> 17:41.330
<i>did it end up tasting better or worse?</i>

17:41.330 --> 17:43.540
WHOAAA

17:42.660 --> 17:43.540
What?

17:44.000 --> 17:46.170
What's up? Does it taste that good?

17:46.170 --> 17:49.210
WHOAAA

17:46.500 --> 17:49.210
This sweet and sour pork is kinda nice.

17:49.340 --> 17:51.340
Yeah, it's irresistible.

17:49.340 --> 17:51.340
WHOAAA

17:51.550 --> 17:53.670
Nico's also super smiley.

17:51.550 --> 17:53.670
WHOAAA

17:53.880 --> 17:56.010
But they're not saying that it's delicious!

17:56.010 --> 17:57.680
Hey! So how's the flavor?

17:57.680 --> 17:59.300
It's kinda nice.

17:59.300 --> 18:01.680
Is that all you're gonna say?

18:02.140 --> 18:04.680
ZONING OUT

18:05.060 --> 18:08.190
<i>It looks like it wasn't a spell
that makes food taste better.</i>

18:09.440 --> 18:11.770
<i>Wait, is this...</i>

18:13.650 --> 18:15.530
<i>They've fallen in love with the dish!</i>

18:17.070 --> 18:19.740
This feeling of my heart just caving in!

18:19.740 --> 18:22.580
Thinking back on it revives the memories
of its sweet and sourness.

18:22.580 --> 18:24.080
Yeah, because it's sweet and sour pork!

18:24.080 --> 18:26.710
What, Keigo, you too?

18:26.910 --> 18:29.540
I fell in love with it first!

18:29.540 --> 18:31.710
They've turned into dumb
middle school love rivals.

18:31.840 --> 18:33.500
This is so annoying!

18:33.500 --> 18:35.590
You're just under a spell.

18:35.590 --> 18:38.180
We're talking about pork here!
Wake up already!

18:38.180 --> 18:39.640
I'm home.

18:40.260 --> 18:41.550
Where were you?

18:41.550 --> 18:44.430
I'm having trouble because they
fell in love with sweet and sour pork.

18:44.430 --> 18:46.350
Just a little shopping.

18:46.520 --> 18:49.100
I wanted to give sweet and sour pork
a birthday gift.

18:49.100 --> 18:50.310
You, too?

18:50.310 --> 18:52.610
Forget about
the sweet and sour pork already!

18:52.610 --> 18:54.440
I'm sorry, Moi.

18:54.650 --> 18:59.110
It's fun being around you and all,
but I think Sweety-Sour and I...

18:59.110 --> 19:01.740
Don't you dare make it sound like
I'm getting dumped.

19:01.990 --> 19:03.580
I found this in the kitchen.

19:03.580 --> 19:05.240
It's because of this
magic powder, isn't it?

19:06.200 --> 19:09.120
- Give that back!
- Explain what this is!

19:09.120 --> 19:11.750
I can't live without
that white powder anymore!

19:11.750 --> 19:13.210
Whoa, phrasing!

19:17.510 --> 19:18.590
Oh, crap!

19:18.720 --> 19:21.720
Hey, come on, don't fight.

19:26.100 --> 19:30.060
<i>When this powder sticks to an object,</i>

19:30.060 --> 19:35.230
<i>and then you consume that powder,
you will get charmed by the object.</i>

19:35.440 --> 19:36.440
Nico.

19:36.440 --> 19:37.110
Yes?

19:37.230 --> 19:38.820
You're kinda nice.

19:38.820 --> 19:40.700
There it is!

19:41.570 --> 19:44.490
I don't know what's going on,
but you seem kinda nice!

19:44.490 --> 19:46.040
That's a big fat no!

19:46.040 --> 19:47.160
You're kinda nice.

19:47.160 --> 19:48.500
You too, Keigo!

19:48.700 --> 19:52.040
They're acting pretty strangely.
Let's run outside for now.

19:52.460 --> 19:53.880
Nico!

19:54.250 --> 19:55.540
Nico!

19:55.540 --> 19:56.880
They're such cheerful zombies!

19:57.420 --> 19:58.460
Hey, Nico.

19:58.460 --> 20:01.720
This is a love potion that makes you fall in love
with whatever it gets sprinkled onto, right?

20:01.720 --> 20:08.680
Yeah. This spell was created by a witch back then
who wanted to charm several men at once.

20:08.850 --> 20:11.440
The witches in the past
certainly had a worldly mindset, huh?

20:11.440 --> 20:16.270
But I get it now. If you want to charm
several people, then powder's the way to go.

20:19.900 --> 20:20.990
For some reason...

20:21.200 --> 20:22.990
My heart is pounding!

20:23.320 --> 20:25.070
I love you!

20:25.910 --> 20:28.870
There're more zombies!
The powder has spread all over town!

20:29.200 --> 20:30.580
My popular era has finally come.

20:30.580 --> 20:31.870
Don't be happy about this.

20:32.210 --> 20:35.920
If we keep flying, the infection
will spread. Let's get down.

20:37.670 --> 20:39.670
It's only a matter of time
before they find us.

20:40.210 --> 20:41.470
Can it be dispelled?

20:43.430 --> 20:45.430
The way to dispel it is...

20:45.430 --> 20:50.100
The witch has to show proof that
she chose one out of the many.

20:50.180 --> 20:52.100
Huh? What does that mean?

20:52.430 --> 20:54.650
I-In other words...

20:55.230 --> 20:59.860
A man must kiss the witch...
s-somewhere on her skin.

21:03.490 --> 21:05.530
Okay, I got it.

21:17.630 --> 21:20.300
Wh-Wh...

21:23.220 --> 21:25.800
Wow, I ran pretty far, huh?

21:25.800 --> 21:27.510
Did I go to this grocery store?

21:27.510 --> 21:28.800
Time to head home.

21:29.050 --> 21:30.260
Hey!

21:30.260 --> 21:32.310
What the heck happened?

21:32.430 --> 21:34.060
M-Moi kissed me!

21:34.140 --> 21:35.060
He what?

21:35.060 --> 21:36.560
Is that true, Morihito?

21:36.730 --> 21:38.400
I just kissed you on the cheek.

21:38.400 --> 21:41.190
It was a necessary action
in order to dispel the magic.

21:41.190 --> 21:43.360
What the hell does he think adolescence is?

21:43.360 --> 21:46.950
I mean a kiss on the cheek,
we did that when we were kids.

21:46.950 --> 21:50.080
It's not that big of a deal,
right, Nico?

21:50.080 --> 21:50.830
What?

21:51.120 --> 21:54.080
Well, I guess it isn't.

21:54.460 --> 21:55.790
All right, let's go home.

21:56.210 --> 21:58.210
What? Is that it?

21:58.670 --> 22:02.090
At this age, you'd think
it'd be a bit more special, right?

22:03.670 --> 22:08.680
<i>It would've been fine on the hand.
My heart is still racing.</i>

22:08.800 --> 22:12.470
<i>Geez, Moi has such a heart of steel.</i>

22:15.940 --> 22:17.810
I can't fall asleep.

22:18.650 --> 22:21.270
Well, today was a bit hectic, so...

22:22.070 --> 22:23.650
My health management is lacking.

22:24.610 --> 22:26.360
I need to stay focused.

23:57.700 --> 24:01.170
Wait, I don't remember anything.
Dang it, did I do it again?

24:01.170 --> 24:02.710
I'm such a weird guy.

24:02.710 --> 24:04.840
He tries to act cool,
but it's so bothersome.

24:04.840 --> 24:07.710
Let's hurry up and end this episode
before he transforms again.

24:07.210 --> 24:12.050
NEXT EPISODE
URON MIRAGE CHAPTER 119:
THE PHASEY HUNT, PART 4
DIARY OF MY FAVORITE ARTIST

24:07.710 --> 24:10.720
This show has been sponsored
by Crescent Medicine.

24:10.720 --> 24:12.050
Ugh, dang it!
